---@field rule_type posthog.logs.LogsExclusionRuleRuleTypeEnum|string Rule kind: severity_sampling, path_drop, or rate_limit (caps matching log volume at ingestion). * `severity_sampling` - Severity-based reduction * `path_drop` - Path exclusion * `rate_limit` - Rate limit
---@field scope_service? string|distilled.Null Optional legacy service-name scope; new rules use `config.filter_group` for matching instead.
---@field scope_path_pattern? string|distilled.Null Optional regex matched against a path-like log attribute when present.
