---@field name? string User-visible label for this rule.
---@field enabled? boolean When false, the rule is ignored by ingestion and listing UIs that show active rules only.
---@field priority? number|distilled.Null Lower numbers are evaluated first; the first matching rule wins. Omit to append after existing rules.
