---Scan a service's logs for volume anomalies
---
---Runs anomaly detection on demand over one service's log volume for the given window. Learns per severity baselines from up to 6 weeks of history and returns per bucket expected bands plus any spike, drop, or silence issues. Synchronous and read only.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/logs/anomalies/scan/`
---Errors: UnprocessableEntity.
---@param input posthog.logs.CreateLogsAnomaliesScanRequest
---@return posthog.logs.LogsAnomalyScanResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_logs_anomalies_scan(input) end

---Per-series log volume with expected bands
---
---Returns log volume over the requested window for every (namespace, environment, severity) series of one service, with a time-of-week expected band derived from the prior weeks of the volume rollup. The window defaults to the last 7 days and may span at most 7 days. Synchronous and read only.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/logs/anomalies/series_bands/`
---Errors: BadRequest, UnprocessableEntity.
---@param input posthog.logs.CreateLogsAnomaliesSeriesBandRequest
---@return posthog.logs.LogsSeriesBandsResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_logs_anomalies_series_band(input) end

